    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τολμ-ήεις</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τολμ-άεις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ</span>] <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			4.89
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enduring,
				steadfast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.284
			</span></i>; <i>daring, bold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.205
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i> l. c.: 
				Sup.
			
			
				contr.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τολμήστατε</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τολμίστατε</span>
			) is f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				984
			</span></i>. The prose form is <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τολμηρός.</span></div>
